     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hey, </div><div><br></div><div>I could achieve a somewhat similar chart with the code below. Take a look. Hope it helps. </div><div><br></div><div>library (tidyverse)</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>x &lt;- data.frame(&quot;x1&quot; = c(40,5,3,2), &quot;x2&quot; = c(38,5,6,1), &quot;x3&quot; = c(45,3,2,1), &quot;group&quot; = c(&quot;a&quot;,&quot;b&quot;, &quot;c&quot;, &quot;d&quot;))</div><div>x1 &lt;- x %&gt;% gather(Variable, value,x1:x3)</div><div><br></div><div>x1$group &lt;- factor(x1$group, levels = rev(levels(x1$group)))</div><div>ggplot(x1, aes(x = Variable, y = value, fill = group, order= -as.numeric(group)))+</div><div>  geom_bar(stat = &quot;identity&quot;)+</div><div>  scale_fill_brewer(palette = &quot;Set2&quot;)</div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/a96184e608717/Screen%20Shot%202018-09-19%20at%2011.15.32%20AM.png?part=0.0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2018-09-19 at 11.15.32 AM.png\" width=\"337\" height=\"302\" style=\"margin-right:0px\"><br></div></div></div></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
