  {
   "id": "TnbxrRqWCgAJ",
   "from": "笑迎新生活",
   "author": "9ee3f13b9db07d5b",
   "date": "2018-09-19T09:55:55Z",
   "subject": "回复：stacked barplot with ggplot2",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div><br></div><div><div>library(reshape2)<br>library(ggplot2)<br>da &lt;- data.frame(x1 = c(40,5,3,2),x2 = c(38,5,6,1),<br>                 x3 = c(45,2,3,1))<br>da &lt;- melt(da)<br>da &lt;- cbind(da, Fact = <br>              c(rep(factor(letters[1:4],<br>                           labels = c(&quot;d&quot;,&quot;c&quot;,&quot;b&quot;,&quot;a&quot;),<br>            levels = c(&quot;d&quot;,&quot;c&quot;,&quot;b&quot;,&quot;a&quot;)),3)))<br>library(ggthemes)<br>colnames(da) &lt;- c(&quot;x&quot;,&quot;y&quot;,&quot;Fact&quot;)<br>da<br>ggplot(da, aes(x = x, y = y, fill = as.factor(Fact))) +<br>  geom_bar(stat = &quot;identity&quot;, position = &quot;stack&quot;) +<br>  theme_wsj() + scale_fill_wsj(&quot;rgby&quot;,&quot;&quot;) </div><div>This is my way.</div><div><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Arial Narrow;padding:2px 0 2px 0\">------------------ 原始邮件 ------------------</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;background:#efefef;padding:8px\"><div><b>发件人:</b> &quot;nanman3012&quot;&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">nanma...@gmail.com</a>&gt;;</div><div><b>发送时间:</b> 2018年9月19日(星期三) 凌晨5:43</div><div><b>收件人:</b> &quot;ggplot2&quot;&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;;</div><div></div><div><b>主题:</b> stacked barplot with ggplot2</div></div><div><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\"></div></div>"
